called God Arcs, yet often treated as little more than expendable hounds. The story follows a young God Eater and their close companions who, after being abandoned by their port, take to the crawler of a sympathetic captain and set out across the Ashlands, facing ever more dangerous Aragami and uncovering hopes of reclaiming the ravaged world.", "summary": "All of sudden, unknown life forms called \u201cOracle cells\u201d begin their uncontrolled consumption of all life on Earth. Their ravenous appetite \u201cdevour\u201d and remarkable adaptability earn them first dread, then awe, and finally the name \u201cAragami\u201d. In the face of an enemy completely immune to conventional weapons, urban civilization collapses, and each day humanity is driven further and further toward extinction.\n\nOne single ray of hope remains for humanity. Following the development of \u201cGod Arcs\u201d\u2014living weapons which incorporate Oracle cells\u2014their wielders, the \u201cGod Eaters,\u201d appear. In a world ravaged by mad gods, these \u201cGod Eaters\u201d fight a desperate war...\n\nCreate your character, and fight for the survival of human-kind in GOD EATER 3. Select your weapon from a wide range of God Arcs and face brand new Aragamis in dynamic high-speed battles. Explore devastated areas you have never seen in the previous GOD EATER games.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/god-eater-3", "videos": [{"id": 12876, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "Wl-AagsSKJs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wl-AagsSKJs", "title": "New GOD EATER Project - Teaser Trailer #1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Wl-AagsSKJs/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 27313, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "AGUg2o2WTU8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AGUg2o2WTU8", "title": "GOD EATER 3 - Update Version 1.30 Story Trailer | PS4, Steam", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AGUg2o2WTU8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 12877, "name": "T